y 2\" of sequels which if you never plaid that game before it's really good. So this game is good, pretty okay, and I would recommend playing Spelunky 2 which is a very good game as well.", "timestamp_created": 1707341878, "timestamp_updated": 1707341878, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157807825", "author": {"steamid": "76561199378383654", "personaname": "jeyestage", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199378383654/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 10051, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 793, "last_played": 1781197019, "avatar": "1857237c6b51ec3cbc9d24404234fc3a45ff50ed"}, "language": "english", "review": "play bandit.\n", "timestamp_created": 1707341031, "timestamp_updated": 1707341031, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}]}